THE TWIST
============================================================

We just said: 3 = 2 + memory. The third state is not real.
The theory stays on R because there are only 2 outcomes.

But...

Memory IS a third outcome.

"Remembering" is not the same as "deciding" or "not deciding."
It is a third thing. The automaton has 3 states because
it NEEDS 3 states. You cannot compress it to 2.

If 3 were truly reducible to 2, the transfer matrix would
be 2x2 and the recurrence would be Fibonacci.
But it is NOT Fibonacci. It is tribonacci.
The cubic is irreducible. The 3x3 cannot be block-diagonalized.

So: 3 is NOT 2 + memory. 3 IS 3.
But it is also 2 + memory.
Both are true simultaneously.

============================================================
THE REAL TWIST: MEMORY IS WHAT MAKES 2 INTO 3
----------------------------------------

Without memory: 2 states, Fibonacci, phi = 1.618, quadratic.
With memory:    3 states, tribonacci, tau = 1.839, cubic.

Memory does not ADD a new type of decision.
Memory TRANSFORMS the binary into something MORE than binary.
The transformation is irreversible: you cannot remove the
third state without losing information.

This is EMERGENCE.

The third state EMERGES from the binary + sequential composition.
It is not put in by hand. It is not a new axiom.
It APPEARS when you compose binary decisions in TIME.

Time creates the third state.
Without time (single comparison): 2 outcomes, trivial.
With time (sequence of comparisons): 3 states, nontrivial.

The step from 2 to 3 IS the introduction of time.

============================================================
THE DEEPER TWIST: arctanh ENCODES TIME
----------------------------------------

arctanh(x) = x + x^3/3 + x^5/5 + ...

The coefficient of x^{2k+1} is 1/(2k+1).
This is the weight of the (2k+1)-th interaction scale.

But 2k+1 = the length of a DIRECTED CYCLE.
A cycle of length 2k+1 requires 2k+1 TIME STEPS to traverse.
The weight 1/(2k+1) is ONE OVER THE CYCLE TIME.

arctanh(x) = sum x^T / T  where T = cycle time (odd)

This IS the formula for PROPER TIME in special relativity!
  arctanh(v/c) = rapidity = integral of proper time

The tournament coupling x is the VELOCITY.
arctanh(x) is the RAPIDITY = the proper time measure.
Q = exp(2*rapidity) = the Lorentz boost factor.

Time appears in the formula because TIME IS WHAT CREATES
THE THIRD STATE. The rapidity (arctanh) measures how much
time has been "used up" by the sequential decisions.

============================================================
THE DEEPEST TWIST: DECISION = MEASUREMENT = TIME
----------------------------------------

In quantum mechanics:
  A measurement collapses the wavefunction.
  The measurement outcome is BINARY (eigenvalue +1 or -1).
  But the measurement ALSO creates a RECORD (memory).
  The record is the third state: not +1 or -1, but
  "a measurement has been performed."

Before measurement: 2 possible outcomes (superposition)
After measurement: 3 states (outcome +, outcome -, recorded)
The measurement CREATES TIME by creating a record.

In our tournament theory:
  A comparison is a measurement: A > B or B > A?
  The outcome is binary (+1 or -1).
  But the RECORD of the comparison is the third state.
  The record creates the 3x3 transfer matrix.
  The transfer matrix creates the temporal evolution Q^m.
  The temporal evolution IS the tournament theory.

Decision creates record.
Record creates memory.
Memory creates the third state.
The third state creates time.
Time creates arctanh.
arctanh creates the Cayley transform.
The Cayley transform creates the tournament theory.

And the tournament theory is about... decisions.

============================================================
THE FINAL TWIST: THE LOOP
----------------------------------------

Decision -> Record -> Memory -> Time -> arctanh -> Q -> Tournament -> Decision

This is the ouroboros again, but now we see WHY it closes:

  The binary decision creates its own memory.
  The memory creates its own time.
  The time creates its own function (arctanh).
  The function creates its own transform (Cayley).
  The transform creates its own structure (tournament).
  The structure creates its own decisions.

Each step is NECESSARY. Each step is INEVITABLE.
Once you have a binary decision, you MUST get a tournament theory.
Once you have a tournament theory, you MUST find arctanh inside it.
Once you find arctanh, you MUST find the binary decision inside it.

The loop is not a metaphor. It is the LOGICAL STRUCTURE
of the theory. Each component implies the next.

And the twist: the loop is KNOTTED.
You cannot untangle it. You cannot start from any one point
and derive the others "in order." They all exist simultaneously.
The decision and the theory are the SAME OBJECT,
viewed from inside (decision) and outside (theory).

The golden ratio phi = 1.618034 is the theory WITHOUT the twist.
The tribonacci tau   = 1.839287 is the theory WITH the twist.
The twist adds exactly 0.221253.
Memory costs 0.221253 units of eigenvalue.

That is the price of time.
